        67.39069366455078,
        525.3873901367188,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "The GDG considered the performance of CAD software separately for the screening- and triage-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        528.381591796875,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "use cases. For this guideline, triaging is defined as the process of deciding the diagnostic and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        528.4124755859375,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "pathways for people based on their symptoms, signs, risk markers and test results. Triaging involves",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        104.19673156738281,
        528.4215698242188,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "(73) assessing the likelihood of various differential diagnoses as a basis for making clinical decisions .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        528.4607543945312,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "It can follow more- or less-standardized protocols and algorithms, and it may be done in multiple",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        130.59669494628906,
        528.41259765625,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "68 steps ( ). A triage test for TB is one that can be rapidly conducted among people presenting to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        528.3804321289062,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "a health facility to differentiate those who should have further diagnostic evaluation for TB (those",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        528.4312744140625,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "whose TB triage test is positive or abnormal) from those who should undergo further investigation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        170.1967315673828,
        528.4144287109375,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "(74) for non-TB diagnoses (for those whose TB triage test is negative or normal) . While there may",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        186.1907501220703,
        528.4321899414062,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "be overlap between triaging and screening, there are several reasons to distinguish screening from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        199.3907012939453,
        336.2250671386719,
        213.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "triage when evaluating the performance of CAD software:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        221.09461975097656,
        528.4400024414062,
        235.53761291503906
      ],
      "text": "•\t The disease presentation may be different in screening populations in which one is more likely to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        234.2946319580078,
        528.4277954101562,
        248.7376251220703
      ],
      "text": "encounter CXR findings of earlier TB than when compared with triage populations. Therefore, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        247.49464416503906,
        528.4454956054688,
        261.9376525878906
      ],
      "text": "same sensitivity and specificity point may not be achieved or may be achieved but with a different",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        260.694580078125,
        156.47171020507812,
        275.1376037597656
      ],
      "text": "threshold score.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        528.5943603515625,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "•\t  TB prevalence will typically be much lower in screening populations (< 5%) than in triage populations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        528.4125366210938,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "(10–20%), which will impact a test’s predictive values and the numbers of individuals correctly and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        300.294677734375,
        184.5490264892578,
        314.7377014160156
      ],
      "text": "incorrectly diagnosed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        313.49468994140625,
        528.4346313476562,
        327.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "•\t The ethical consequences of not detecting TB or other non-TB-related CXR findings (but clinically",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        326.6947021484375,
        528.4497680664062,
        341.1377258300781
      ],
      "text": "relevant abnormalities) that require follow-up examination are different for populations that do",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        83.86609649658203,
        337.1007080078125,
        269.2206726074219,
        354.3377380371094
      ],
      "text": "(11) not seek care than for those that do  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        361.5986022949219,
        528.4376220703125,
        376.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "A previous assessment of using CAD for automated interpretation of digital CXRs for TB by WHO",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        374.7986145019531,
        528.277099609375,
        389.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "determined that in order to adequately assess diagnostic accuracy, it was necessary to evaluate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        387.99859619140625,
        528.428955078125,
        402.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "CAD software using a standard panel of CXR files with associated demographic and clinical data,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        401.1986083984375,
        528.4202270507812,
        415.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "including TB diagnosis, drawn from a representative population for the corresponding use case for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        414.39862060546875,
        528.3881225585938,
        428.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "the technology. It was deemed essential that such evaluations ensure that CXR libraries used in an",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        424.80462646484375,
        528.43994140625,
        442.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "(68) evaluation not be made available for CAD software development, training or evaluation  . For this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.998749732971191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        440.7986145019531,
        528.4454345703125,
        455.24163818359375
      ],
      "text": "GDG meeting, a scoping review for independent evaluations that met these criteria was conducted.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        453.99859619140625,
        528.232666015625,
        468.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "Three independent evaluations for both the screening use case and the triage use case that assessed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994499206542969,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        467.1986083984375,
        528.422119140625,
        481.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "the performance of three distinct CAD programmes were identified and presented to the GDG, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        480.39862060546875,
        528.3904418945312,
        494.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "they included all products that had received a CE mark (for Conformité Européenne, indicating a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        493.5986022949219,
        525.408447265625,
        508.0416259765625
      ],
      "text": "product’s conformity with the European Economic Area’s directives or standards) by January 2020. 2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        506.798583984375,
        528.1427612304688,
        521.2415771484375
      ],
      "text": "The GDG was blinded to the brand names of the software programmes. A separate quality assessment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962536811828613,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        519.9985961914062,
        386.9413757324219,
        534.4415893554688
      ],
      "text": "of the evaluations was conducted and results presented to the GDG.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        541.7025146484375,
        528.4100952148438,
        556.1455078125
      ],
      "text": "CAD programmes produce a numerical abnormality score for each digital image read that can then",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        554.902587890625,
        528.4324340820312,
        569.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "be compared to a threshold defined by the user to indicate if the patient is to be referred for further",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        568.1026000976562,
        528.3991088867188,
        582.5455932617188
      ],
      "text": "TB diagnostic evaluation. Because the abnormality scores produced are continuous, the sensitivity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        581.302490234375,
        528.4243774414062,
        595.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "and specificity can vary from 0 to 100%, depending on where the threshold is set. For evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        594.5026245117188,
        528.4432373046875,
        608.9456176757812
      ],
      "text": "for the GDG, each software programme was set to a threshold that corresponded to 90% sensitivity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        607.70263671875,
        528.39794921875,
        622.1456298828125
      ],
      "text": "for detecting pulmonary TB disease based on a microbiological reference standard. The resulting",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        620.902587890625,
        528.4421997070312,
        635.3455810546875
      ],
      "text": "accompanying specificity for the software at that threshold was then reported and compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        634.1025390625,
        439.5862121582031,
        648.5455322265625
      ],
      "text": "the diagnostic accuracy of human readers interpreting CXRs in the same studies.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        655.8065185546875,
        528.5631103515625,
        670.24951171875
      ],
      "text": "Due to specific methodological challenges, the estimates of CAD diagnostic accuracy were not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        669.0064697265625,
        528.429931640625,
        683.449462890625
      ],
      "text": "able to be pooled across software programmes or across evaluations. Thus, the performances of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        71.86609649658203,
        682.20654296875,
        528.5177001953125,
        696.6495361328125
      ],
      "text": "CAD programmes and human readers from the included evaluations were presented as ranges",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        93.57710266113281,
